WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:09.920
In 1923, Mustafa Kemal Ataturk founded Turkey from the ashes of the Ottoman Empire.

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:12.220
His goal was to reorient society toward the West.

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:15.549
He abolished the caliphate, reformed the legal code, and changed

00:00:15.549 --> 00:00:16.549
the alphabet.

00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:19.660
He gave women equal rights and embraced the
separation of mosque and state.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:21.750
For decades, the West took Turkey for granted.

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:25.950
Turkey was a NATO member and stood firm against
communism, terrorism and Islamism.

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:29.230
Turkey was among the first Muslim countries
to have a female prime minister.

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:30.750
It aspired to EU membership.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:34.320
As a secular democracy, it
stood in contrast to most Muslim majority countries.

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:36.480
Recep Tayyip Erdogan changed this.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:39.090
He declared his goal to “raise a religious
generation.”

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:42.070
Over 14 years, he curtailed free press and opposition.

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:44.720
He Islamized curricula, and pushed women from
the public sphere.

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:45.960
His is the anti-Ataturk.

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:47.380
Islamism is ascendant.

00:00:47.399 --> 00:00:49.740
Secularists have been cowed into silence.

00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:51.270
But is Turkey’s change permanent?

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:54.000
Some hope that when Erdogan goes, the old Turkey will return.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.450
That’s wishful thinking.

00:00:55.450 --> 00:00:59.560
Erdogan has brainwashed a generation, purged the military, and reshaped bureaucracy.

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:01.340
Plus, the opposition is incompetent.

00:01:01.340 --> 00:01:03.210
The good old days are gone.

00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:06.460
With or without Erdogan, Turkey's going to be a problem for decades to come.

00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:09.600
Do you think secularists can rebound in Turkey?

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:13.700
Let us know in your comments. Also, let us know what other topics you’d like our scholars

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:19.960
to cover in 60 seconds, and be sure to like and subscribe for more research and videos from AEI.

